# TASK/KEYOWNER, the console path (Cconin/kernel console read) with the
# accessories loaded: EmuDESK (no #Z), card = tools/make-sd-image.sh 64 MiB
# (C:\ACC\SYSACC.NAC + C:\SYSACC2.NAC alive in their evnt_multi(MU_MESAG)).
# Ctrl-Z = File > Execute EmuCON (the CLIITEM shortcut, as
# measurement-2026-10-05-arch03-3a/method/emucon-schedule.py), then type
# "ver" Return, "dir" Return, "exit" Return (back to the desktop).
# Ticks hz_200 after "[desk] desktop up" (desk-arm-m3.py). IKBD make codes:
# Ctrl 1D, Z 2C, v 2F, e 12, r 13, d 20, i 17, x 2D, t 14, Return 1C;
# break = make | 0x80.
